{"id":"8876d83b2589a917","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-presheaf.md","title":"Presheaf","display":"df-presheaf — Presheaf","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-presheaf","aliases":["58-df-presheaf","Presheaf"],"display":"df-presheaf — Presheaf","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-presheaf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-presheaf</span><span>Presheaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-presheaf — Presheaf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span> 使用内部依赖定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 是下述定义的六元范畴代码，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 下使用；箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle V,U\\rangle\">\\(\\langle V,U\\rangle\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq U\">\\(V\\subseteq U\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D^{\\operatorname{op}}=\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathcal D^{\\operatorname{op}}=\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal D)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\tau,\n\\{\\langle V,U\\rangle:V,U\\in\\tau\\land V\\subseteq U\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle V,U\\rangle,V\\rangle:V,U\\in\\tau\\land V\\subseteq U\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle V,U\\rangle,U\\rangle:V,U\\in\\tau\\land V\\subseteq U\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\langle V,W\\rangle,\\langle U,V\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle U,W\\rangle\\rangle:U,V,W\\in\\tau\\land U\\subseteq V\\subseteq W\\},\n\\{\\langle U,\\langle U,U\\rangle\\rangle:U\\in\\tau\\}\n\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\tau,\n\\{\\langle V,U\\rangle:V,U\\in\\tau\\land V\\subseteq U\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle V,U\\rangle,V\\rangle:V,U\\in\\tau\\land V\\subseteq U\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle V,U\\rangle,U\\rangle:V,U\\in\\tau\\land V\\subseteq U\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\langle V,W\\rangle,\\langle U,V\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle U,W\\rangle\\rangle:U,V,W\\in\\tau\\land U\\subseteq V\\subseteq W\\},\n\\{\\langle U,\\langle U,U\\rangle\\rangle:U\\in\\tau\\}\n\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}presheaf} \\vdash \\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathcal C\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}presheaf} \\vdash \\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathcal C\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Presheaf: contravariant functor from topology to category; assigns data to open sets</li>\n<li>Sheaf: presheaf satisfying sheaf axioms (gluing); unique gluing for compatible sections</li>\n<li>Stalks: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}_x = \\varinjlim_{U \\ni x} \\mathcal{F}(U)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}_x = \\varinjlim_{U \\ni x} \\mathcal{F}(U)\\)</span>; germs at point <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span></li>\n<li>Sheafification: any presheaf has associated sheaf via <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tilde{\\mathcal{F}} = \\operatorname{GermSheaf}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\tilde{\\mathcal{F}} = \\operatorname{GermSheaf}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>Bredon, Sheaf Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle V,U\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D^{\\operatorname{op}}=\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\tau,\n\\{\\langle V,U\\rangle:V,U\\in\\tau\\land V\\subseteq U\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle V,U\\rangle,V\\rangle:V,U\\in\\tau\\land V\\subseteq U\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle V,U\\rangle,U\\rangle:V,U\\in\\tau\\land V\\subseteq U\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\langle V,W\\rangle,\\langle U,V\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle U,W\\rangle\\rangle:U,V,W\\in\\tau\\land U\\subseteq V\\subseteq W\\},\n\\{\\langle U,\\langle U,U\\rangle\\rangle:U\\in\\tau\\}\n\\right\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}presheaf} \\vdash \\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{OpenPoset}(X,\\tau)^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathcal C\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}_x = \\varinjlim_{U \\ni x} \\mathcal{F}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\tilde{\\mathcal{F}} = \\operatorname{GermSheaf}(\\mathcal{F})","display":false}],"bytes":2129,"backlinks":[{"id":"5caf5b54bcc1111e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3de4d546216326d8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b2cb2118f43b23b3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-978","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-presheaf.md|58-df-presheaf]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["877f1061e295cf5f","a87b7e1119b63b2c","815e63e5071e7b58","e637becf421e4e61"]}